.Sh ABSTRACT
.Nm PQFreeBSD
composes several policies that are mandatory in the ordinary sense
.Pq the subject cannot elect them away :
integrity labels, file-firewall rules, capability mode, a restricted and
repaired access matrix, Integrity Evidence, successive policy.
Some load as modules of the TrustedBSD MAC Framework.
Some do not
.Pq Capsicum, repaired
.Em A_D
in prevent mode, pqk .
The Framework is not the only MAC in the suite, and MAC is not only the
Framework.
.Pp
.Xr pqac 7
is the basis: authorization on a von Neumann
.Fx
defender is not an instance of a BQP-hard naming problem.
Cryptographic hops that remain RSA or ECC have no post-quantum resistance
at those hops.
Lemmas: unlike layers do not inherit a namei TOCTOU
.Pq T20 ;
federation min-cut is extra virtual dimensions of channel
.Pq T21 .
.Sh BASIS
Read
.Xr pqac 7
first.
The defender is GENERIC with
.Ql options MAC .
The adversary is
.Em BQP
plus Grover, plus a hypothesized instrument on the plant
.Pq T3 .
Exoterically, DAC, LOMAC, and the MMU are interpreted predicates; they do
not reduce to period-finding.
Esoterically those predicates are electrical events; if
.Em O
does not factor through a kernel-visible subject, T1 and T2 are silent.
.Pp
This page does not re-prove T1–T5.
It inherits them and names the morphisms the slogans omitted.
.Sh TRUSTEDBSD
The TrustedBSD Project supplied a loadable MAC Framework, OpenBSM, and
related kernel pieces.
This suite consumes that work.
It does not treat the Framework as the only mandatory policy.
