RBAC is roles, permissions, sessions.
LOMAC is a Biba-like integrity lattice.
SEBSD is Type Enforcement
.Pq FLASK, types, a compiled policy language .
Groups-as-roles is how this suite
.Em binds
humans and agents to those axioms; it is not the axiom.
A skill named RBAC that loaded both would teach the operator that types
are grades.
They are not.
Conjunction is not a product of proofs
.Pq Xr pqac 7 .
